File transfer and command execution in the guest

Usage: testanyware file <COMMAND>

Commands:
  upload    Upload a file from host to guest
  download  Download a file from guest to host
  exec      Run a command in the guest, capture stdout/stderr/exit
  help      Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
